    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2c/Lycoris_Flower_of_Death_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260122015301\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Lycoris Flower of Death Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"917\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Lycoris Flower of Death Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lycoris_Flower_of_Death_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2c/Lycoris_Flower_of_Death_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260122015301\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>死亡之花</b>\n</p><p>一名精通拷问和审讯艺术的年轻忍者。她的剑能掀起血雨腥风，却从不给受害者带来甜蜜的死亡解脱。她造成的伤口喷出的鲜血会形成红色花朵的图案。\n\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae5b3b6150bca1bc44a1b909c7c56fd2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Spicy_Lycoris_Queen-s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:93px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Spicy_Lycoris_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" title=\"Spicy Lycoris Queen&#39;s blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg (264 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:93px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/cd/S